Ideas
-----

phaserjs/phaser (MIT)
  https://github.com/phaserjs/phaser
  No Phaser code is bundled. Three things are written from scratch after it:
  the burst of particles where the ball lands (thrown out at once at random
  angles and speeds, pulled down by gravity, gone after a fixed lifespan), the
  full-screen toggle that hides the navigation bar where it can, and the sound
  stopping while the tab is hidden. Its licence is reproduced so that the
